# Native build artifacts. The `lib` and `asan` targets drop throwaway output in
# native/ (and a temp dir); none of that is committed.
*.o
*.a
cnx_selftest
native/libcoinxt.*

# The SHIPPED per-platform libraries ARE committed, under
# src/code/<arch>-<platform>/, alongside src/code/MANIFEST.sha256 - the same
# place and shape as every other suite member. `sh native/build.sh pack` puts
# them there.
#
# A blanket `*.so` / `*.dylib` / `*.dll` used to live here, from before there was
# anything to ship, and it silently excluded exactly the file the packaged
# extension needs: `git add` reported nothing wrong, and the omission would only
# have surfaced as a bind failure on an engine. The ignores below are therefore
# scoped to where dev artifacts actually land, and src/code/ is re-included
# explicitly so a future broad rule cannot re-hide it.
!src/code/**
